          "_name": "people04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"people04\" plugins=\"Masonry\" group=\"People\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Card</header>\n\t\t<select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"12\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image\" name=\"showImage\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 mb-0 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>SodaPeak™ Real Customer Reviews</b></h3>\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"></h5>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row mbr-masonry\" data-masonry=\"{&quot;percentPosition&quot;: true }\">\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}} active\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBut it is most effective if you keep realistic expectations from it. Nothing was changed overnight, but it is helpful for me to relax more quickly and to be more concentrated during the day. There are days when it affects me more and some other days it is not as noticeable. Overall, however, it is quite good.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img26-267x249.webp\" data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\" alt=\"Daniel W. – Chicago\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</b><br><b>Verified Purchase&nbsp;</b><br><b>– Michael Thompson, Denver, Colorado</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">I have been listening to Quantum Wave for around 2-3 weeks, and one thing I notice most is the calming effect it brings into my brain throughout the day. It is common for me to be over-thinking, particularly at night, but I must admit that this audio made a great difference in reducing that kind of thinking. The 7-minute practice makes it easier for me to be consistent.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/img25-230x278.webp\" data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\" alt=\"James R. – Chicago\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</b><br><b>Verified Purchase&nbsp;</b><br><b>\n</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><b>– Jason Miller, Austin, Texas</b></div></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{columns}}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInitially, I didn’t feel anything, and honestly thought that it wouldn’t work. But then I kept using it regularly, and slowly started to realize the changes such as feeling less stressed and thinking clearly. It didn’t happen instantly, but over time, but it did work when I used headphones the right way.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-wrapper mt-4 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/t2-269x273.webp\" data-slide-to=\"4\" data-bs-slide-to=\"4\" alt=\"Michael T. – Dallas\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .img-wrapper\"><b>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</b><br><b>Verified Purchase&nbsp;</b><br><b>– Emily Carter, Seattle, Washington</b></h5>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
