          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header11\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <a href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/13665/498/2/?\"><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/chatgpt20image20sep20272020262012-56-5420pm-815x442.webp\" alt=\"Millionaire Partner System™ \"></a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper text-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Mobirise Website Builder</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Quantum Wave is presented as a modern daily wellness supplement formulated to complement an active, health-conscious lifestyle. The product is designed around the idea of providing nutritional support that can fit easily into a consistent daily routine. Rather than being positioned as a replacement for a balanced diet, regular physical activity, quality sleep, or professional healthcare, Quantum Wave is intended to work alongside healthy everyday habits.<br><br>The concept behind Quantum Wave focuses on supporting general wellness and helping individuals maintain their daily sense of energy, vitality, and overall balance. Its formula is presented as a convenient way for adults to add targeted nutritional ingredients to their routine without making major changes to their lifestyle.<br><br>For people managing busy schedules, maintaining consistent wellness habits can sometimes be challenging. A daily supplement such as Quantum Wave may offer a simple addition to an established routine. The goal is to make nutritional support convenient and straightforward, while allowing users to continue focusing on the fundamentals of healthy living.<br><br>As with other dietary supplements, results and experiences can vary from person to person. Quantum Wave should be used according to its product label and recommended serving instructions. It is also important to consider individual dietary needs, existing medications, and personal health circumstances when introducing any new supplement into a daily routine.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"https://a2c97pj8k6frwc65kex9l-unzp.hop.clickbank.net\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-shopping-cart mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Buy Now!</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
