          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content4\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"11\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1-1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"title col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>How Does Quietum Plus Works?</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle align-center mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><div>Quantum Wave is presented as a daily wellness formula designed to complement the body’s normal nutritional needs and support overall energy, focus, and vitality. The concept behind the formula is to provide selected ingredients in a convenient daily format that can become part of a consistent wellness routine.</div><div><br></div><div>Rather than working as an instant solution, Quantum Wave is intended to fit into a broader healthy lifestyle. Its approach centers on regular use alongside balanced nutrition, adequate hydration, physical activity, and healthy sleep habits. The ingredients are intended to provide nutritional support that may help users maintain their everyday sense of well-being.</div><div><br></div><br><div><b>Supporting Daily Energy</b></div><div>One of the main ideas behind Quantum Wave is supporting normal daily energy and vitality. By supplying nutritional ingredients as part of a regular routine, the formula is designed for people who want additional support while managing busy schedules and everyday demands.</div><div><br></div><br><div><b>Supporting Focus and Mental Performance</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>\n</b></span></div><div>Quantum Wave is also presented as a formula focused on mental wellness and daily concentration. Its ingredients are intended to complement normal cognitive function, helping users maintain a focused and productive routine. Individual experiences can vary, and supplements should not be considered a treatment for cognitive or neurological conditions.</div><br><br><div><b>Complementing Overall Wellness</b></div><div>The formula is designed to work as part of an overall wellness approach rather than replace healthy habits. Consistent nutrition, exercise, hydration, and quality sleep remain important foundations of everyday health. Quantum Wave can be incorporated into that routine according to the product's recommended directions.</div><br><br><div><b>Consistent Daily Use</b></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>\n</b></span></div><div>Like many dietary supplements, Quantum Wave is intended for regular use rather than occasional consumption. Following the serving instructions on the product label helps maintain a consistent routine. How an individual responds can depend on factors such as diet, lifestyle, and personal circumstances.</div><br><div>Overall, Quantum Wave works by providing a convenient combination of nutritional ingredients intended to support everyday energy, focus, vitality, and general wellness. It should be used according to its label directions, and people with medical conditions or those taking medications should consult a qualified healthcare professional before starting a new supplement.</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">\n</span></div></h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LEARN MORE</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\">LIVE DEMO</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
