          "_name": "header11",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"header11\" group=\"Headers\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n                <a href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/13665/498/2/?\"><img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/chatgpt20image20sep20272020262012-56-5420pm-815x442.webp\" alt=\"Millionaire Partner System™ \"></a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <div class=\"text-wrapper text-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Mobirise Website Builder</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Quantum Wave is presented as a wellness-focused program built around the connection between daily energy, mental focus, vitality, and healthy lifestyle habits. Its overall concept is based on supporting the body's natural processes through a combination of nutritional awareness and consistent daily wellness practices.<br><br>The body relies on nutrients, adequate hydration, quality sleep, physical activity, and balanced nutrition to maintain normal energy production and physiological function. Similarly, the brain requires sufficient energy and a healthy internal environment to support normal concentration, attention, and everyday cognitive performance.<br><br>Quantum Wave's approach brings these areas together rather than focusing on a single aspect of wellness. The goal is to provide a convenient framework that can complement healthy routines and encourage consistency in everyday habits.<br><br>It's important to distinguish general wellness science from product-specific evidence. Unless Quantum Wave has published clinical trials or ingredient-specific research, claims that the program itself is scientifically proven to deliver particular health outcomes should not be made. Individual experiences can also vary.<br><br>Overall, the science-related foundation of Quantum Wave can be described through established principles involving nutrition, energy metabolism, cognitive wellness, recovery, and healthy lifestyle practices. Used as intended, it is best considered a complement to—not a replacement for—a balanced diet, regular exercise, sufficient sleep, and appropriate professional healthcare.<br></p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"https://a2c97pj8k6frwc65kex9l-unzp.hop.clickbank.net\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\"><span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-shopping-cart mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>Buy Now!</a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
