          "_name": "features11",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features11\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <!---->\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Image\" min=\"2\" max=\"6\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitleCard\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparentCard\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"!transparentCard\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#bed3f9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid' : fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"title\">\n            <h3 mbr-if=\"showTitle\" class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                <b>Product List</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h4 mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                Subtitle\n            </h4>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <a href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/13665/498/2/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-qm7i47qm7i47qm7i-815x443.webp\" alt=\"Quantum Wave\" title></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"top-line\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Bonus #1: Quantum Shift Journal\n</b><div><b>Value: $97\n</b></div><div><b>Today: Free\n</b></div><div><b><br></b></div></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".cost\">\n                                            $39</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                                            Quantum Shift Journal is a concise but highly effective journaling guide that will assist you in maintaining your consistency and being more aware of your mental development. This tool enables you to log your thoughts, feelings, your level of concentration, and the experience you had while using Quantum Wave. The process of monitoring all these small changes will enable you to become more motivated.\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <a href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/13665/498/2/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-vv1zo5vv1zo5vv1z-815x443.webp\" alt=\"Quantum Wave\" title></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"top-line\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Bonus #2: Breath of Earth Grounding Track\n</b><div><b>Value: $67\n</b></div><div><b>Today: Free\n</b></div><div><b><br></b></div></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".cost\">\n                                            $49</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                                            This relaxation audio, which lasts for 11 minutes, is produced specifically to assist you in grounding yourself, calming your mind, and focusing your thoughts. This audio is in tandem with the overall program since it is meant to aid you in getting into a relaxed state of mind, especially after a long day or when you’re preparing for sleep.\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"item features-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n            <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md-{{imageWidth}}\">\n                        <div class=\"image-wrapper\">\n                            <a href=\"https://maxwebleads.com/13665/498/2/?\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-fyo94zfyo94zfyo9-815x443.webp\" alt=\"Quantum Wave\" title></a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <div class=\"row\">\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"top-line\">\n                                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCard\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\"><b>Bonus #3: Quick-Start Guide\n</b><div><b>Value: $67\n</b></div><div><b>Today: Free\n</b></div><div><b><br></b></div></h4>\n                                        <p class=\"cost mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".cost\">\n                                            $49</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-10' : fullWidth}\">\n                                    <div class=\"bottom-line\">\n                                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                                            Using the Quick Start Guide will give you clear directions on how to utilize Quantum Wave properly. The Quick Start Guide gives you a head start, showing you how to practice good listening and get the most out of the program. With this guide, you'll be able to use the program safely and properly right from the start.\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
