          "_name": "content8",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#1f436d\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Supports Daily Energy:&nbsp;</b></span>&nbsp;Designed around principles that may help complement healthy habits associated with maintaining normal energy and vitality throughout the day.</li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\">\n</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Promotes Mental Focus: </b>The program emphasizes factors that can support a focused and productive daily routine, including healthy nutrition, rest, hydration, and consistent lifestyle habits.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Encourages Overall Vitality:</b>&nbsp;Quantum Wave is positioned as a convenient wellness solution for people looking to support their general sense of well-being and everyday performance.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Fits Into Daily Wellness Routines:</b>&nbsp;Its approach can be incorporated alongside balanced nutrition, regular physical activity, adequate sleep, and proper hydration.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Supports a Consistent Lifestyle:</b>&nbsp;Rather than relying on quick solutions, Quantum Wave promotes consistency and attention to the everyday habits that contribute to long-term wellness.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Convenient Wellness Approach:&nbsp;</b>The program is presented in an accessible format intended to make wellness-related guidance easier to incorporate into everyday life.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
